        "original_id": "a37a4919-90d9-5925-b0c8-d914607f14f0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gerald Grosvenor, Hugh Grosvenor, Nicholas Ashley-Cooper, Simon Elliot, Charles, Prince of Wales\n- Roles: 6th Duke of Westminster, 7th Duke of Westminster, 12th Earl of Shaftesbury\n- Topics: succession, wealth, family and godparent relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Gerald Grosvenor was succeeded by his son Hugh Grosvenor as Duke of Westminster, making Hugh Grosvenor the 7th Duke of Westminster.\n- Hugh Grosvenor, 7th Duke of Westminster, is estimated to be worth US$13 billion and is described as the world's richest person aged under 30.\n- Nicholas Ashley-Cooper, 12th Earl of Shaftesbury, is the godson of Gerald Grosvenor, 6th Duke of Westminster.\n- Nicholas Ashley-Cooper, 12th Earl of Shaftesbury, is also the godson of Simon Elliot, who is the brother-in-law of Charles, Prince of Wales.",
